{title: Senorita}
{artist: Farhan Akhtar Shankar Ehsaan Loy}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Na main samjha, na main jaana,        [A]Jo bhi tumne muzse kaha hai seno [Bm]rita
[Bm]Magar phir bhi, na jaane kyun,        [Bm]Mujhe sunke accha laga hai seno [A]rita
[A]Mujhko baahon mein tum [E]ghero,        Samjhi na seno [A]rita
Chaahat ke [D]do pal bhi, mil [A]paaye,        [C#]Duniya mein yeh bhi kum [F#m]hai kya
Do pal ko [D]toh aao kho [A]jaaye,        [C#]Bhule hum hota gum [F#m]hai kya senorita
[A]Suno suno senorita kehte hain hum kya,        [A]Nighaahon ne nighaahon se
[A]Kahi armaano ki dastaan hai seno [Bm]rita,        [Bm]Yeh chaahat ki mohabbat ki
[Bm]Sari duniyame ek hi zuban hai seno [A]rita,        [A]Mujhse ab nazar na [E]phero
Aao paas tum [A]mere,        [A]Mujhko baahon mein tum [E]ghero
Samjhi na seno [A]rita,        Chaahat ke [D]do pal bhi, mil [A]paaye
[C#]Duniya mein yeh bhi kum [F#m]hai kya,        Do pal ko [D]toh aao kho [A]jaaye
[C#]Bhule hum hota gum [F#m]hai kya senorita,        [A]Suno suno senorita kehte hain hum kya
[F#]Jo bhi pal bee [Bm]ta,        [B]Hey senori [A]ta
[G]Har pal tumne hai dil [D]jeeta,        Bus [E]itni si toh baat [A]hai
[A]Mujhko baahon mein tum [E]ghero,        Samjhi na seno [A]rita
